    "created_at": "2017-10-26T14:18:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-26T14:18:34Z",
    "body": " For the simple use case of “this video was recorded at the wrong speed”, there’s preservesPitch. For anything more complicated, including arbitrary pitch shifting, there’s WebAudio and the MediaElementSourceNode. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
